            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument, erected in the year 2000, is in the municipality of Gettysburg in Pennsylvania. This municipality is in Adams County, Pennsylvania which has Carroll County Maryland to the southeast and Frederick County Maryland to the southwest. This monument is categorised as a contributing property."
