            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument was established in 2000 in Adams County, Pennsylvania which has Frederick County, Maryland to its southwest and Carroll County, Maryland to its southeast. The monument is placed in the municipality of Gettysburg and is categorized as a Contributing Property."
